# Build-time configuration for the runtime origin (M2 deployment).
# Copy to .env for local experimentation, or set these in the deploy
# workflow inputs (docs/architecture/deployment.md) — no secrets here.

# Main origin for the exact-origin bootstrap check. Derived by default
# (dev: port swap to 5173; production: strip the `runtime.` hostname
# prefix). Set only when the runtime origin is NOT a subdomain of the main
# origin (strategies (b)/(c)), e.g. VITE_MAIN_ORIGIN=https://nova.example
# VITE_MAIN_ORIGIN=

# Mirror of the nova build's runtime-origin override; only needed if the
# runtime app ever embeds the main origin (it does not today).
# VITE_RUNTIME_ORIGIN=
